  "articleBody": "It’s easy to think you can handle minor storm damage yourself, but there are definitely times when calling in the pros is absolutely essential. You should seriously consider professional help if you're dealing with any kind of roofing damage, especially if it's significant or involves potential leaks into your attic. Another big one is structural damage; if walls are compromised or your foundation is affected, that's definitely not a DIY job. Water intrusion is also a huge red flag. Even if it seems like a small leak, water can lead to hidden mold and extensive damage if not properly dried and remediated. Any work that requires permits or needs to meet specific building codes, like major repairs or modifications, also screams for professional expertise. And honestly, if you're feeling overwhelmed or unsure about the full extent of the damage, that's a clear signal to call in a reputable contractor like HH Remodeling LLC. We've got the experience to identify hidden problems, work with your insurance, and ensure the repairs are done right and last for years to come. Don't risk bigger headaches down the line by trying to tackle something beyond your skill set.",
  "datePublished": "2026-08-09"
}